1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,042
Hello, Anna! How are you?

2
00:00:03,042 --> 00:00:05,580
Good, thanks! And you?

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,227
Good too. What would you like to drink?

4
00:00:08,227 --> 00:00:10,845
I would like a tea, please.

5
00:00:10,845 --> 00:00:13,097
With milk or without milk?

6
00:00:13,097 --> 00:00:14,691
Without milk. And you?

7
00:00:14,691 --> 00:00:17,210
I will have a coffee with milk.

8
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,860
Would you also like a cake?

9
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,681
Yes, please. I am hungry.

10
00:00:22,681 --> 00:00:25,315
Me too. The cake is good!

11
00:00:25,315 --> 00:00:27,231
Is your tea hot?

12
00:00:27,231 --> 00:00:29,209
Yes. I will wait a little longer.
